Selected short spellings, especially nice and ice, receive negative values,
as do ce word pieces and short e continuations after c.  The isolated
ci/ци pieces receive a small positive value.  Case and the preceding token
modify some predictions.  Similar s endings in East Asian transcriptions,
Chinese ice, and repeated middle-dot leaders are included as side responses.
Everything else is zero; document boundaries clear the previous-token state.
