"""A 'ron' spelling/completion signal with a few related lexical cues.

Subwords completing ron are strongest; whole words and long continuations
are usually weaker. Common verb endings, -hedron, and environ are discounted.
Transliteration covers Cyrillic and some Arabic spellings; Japanese loan
syllables get a weaker response. Electron/proton words and a few on/off
constructions are separate cues. Only recent text is kept, reset per document.
